SUMMARY:An Asexual Show About Cunnilingus by Eliott Simpson
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning asexual comedian Eliott Simpson has spent the pas
 t decade telling jokes about not wanting sex\, so what happens when they fi
 nd themselves in love with someone who does? Cum see a surprisingly raunchy
  exploration of identity\, doubts\, fluids\, flaps and happy endings (shush
 \, not like that). Don’t miss out on the sexiest asexual show to ever gra
 ce the Fringe. 'Gregarious and excitable' (TheWeeReview.com). ***** 'Wonder
 fully intense\, awkward and infinitely funny' (TheFringeQueer.com). **** 'A
  fully-formed stand-up' (NeurodiverseReview.co.uk). **** 'Weird as f**k' (J
 aney Godley). 'Accessible and absurd' (TheNorwichRadical.com). 'Infectiousl
 y funny' (Indiependent.co.uk).\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-a
 tlas/event/an-asexual-show-about-cunnilingus-by-eliott-simpson-25228/
